        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sitan temo Yobu kendo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo acel jomalaika jobino ruwaŋ Rwoth, aka jakwor Sitan bende obino i dier jo ruwaŋ Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth openjo Sitan ni, “Iwok yukune?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitan odwoko ni, “Awok thembo ka gi kaca, kilera i piny.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth openjo jakwor Sitan ni, “Iliewo ye ŋeca paran Yobu? Ongoye ŋata cale gi go i piny, go ongoye g'apuse aka obedo jacwo m'otire ma lworo Were aka kitim reco. Go fodi ocwire i timo gim'otire makada nende itemo kwinyan kwoŋ go, reyo woko go m'ongoye atoŋa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitan odwoko Rwoth ni, “Del ri del! Dhano miyo kisi gima go nitie gine ŋey wonyali kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To riey cingin igey cokin pere gi delkwoŋe, aka Yobu lakwoŋin ruwaŋin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Sitan ni, “Meno ber go nitie i cingin, t'ikir'igey kwo pere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Sitan oeye woko ruwaŋ Rwoth, aka otula kwoŋ Yobu g'adholin wok i par tiende tundo i tipin wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yobu okadho to bedo i buru aka okwanyo thago to cako gwaro gine delkwoŋe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo dhako pere openjo go ni, “Fodi icwire timo gim'otire? Kwoŋ Were, aka itho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yobu odwoko ni, “Iluwo paka mon mamiŋ joluwo. Walajolo nyaka bero kende wok i cingi Were m'ongoye raco?” I gime je Yobu k'otimo reco i luwo pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Merin pa Yobu jobino",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Merin pa Yobu adek jowinjo kwoŋ teko me je m'oyido opodho kwoŋ go, aka kisi dhano owok peco pere bino. Merin me jobedo Elifaz ma wok i tindi madwoŋ Teman, Bilidad ma wok i piny Suha, kodi Zofar ma wok i piny Namath. Joromo kanyacel kadho kweyo cuny gi yomo cuny Yobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo joneno go gi bor, jok'onyalo niaŋ kwoŋe, aka jotiŋo dwondi gin malo to joywak, joyeco nangin pajo aka jobolo fukefuke i koyo i wi jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobedo piny i lowo gi go odieceŋ abirio gi wor abirio, aka ongoye ŋat'oluwo wac rigo, kwoŋbedo joneno ni candirok pere oyido dwoŋ swa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
